      "message": "* **Location:** Multiple files (e.g., `cli.cc`, `updater.cc`, `ft_scsi.cc`)  \n* **Issue:** Google style recommends making local variables `const` if they are not modified after initialization. This reduces cognitive load.  \n* **Remediation:** Add `const` to `auto` declarations that never mutate.\n\nExamples to update:\n\n* In `cli.cc`: `const auto wp_res \u003d ParseWpArea(args[1]);`  \n* In `updater.cc`: `const uint32_t pages \u003d ...;`  \n* In `updater.cc`: `const bool is_config_update \u003d ...;`",
