      "message": "* **Location:** `util/focaltech/updater_test.cc` \\-\\\u003e Mock setups utilizing `Invoke`  \n* **Issue:** In the mock setups, the trailing return type is explicitly written out (e.g., `-\u003e std::expected\u003csize_t, Error\u003e`). Under Google style (and generally in C++14+), lambda return types should be deduced by the compiler unless they are ambiguous.  \n* **Remediation:** Remove the trailing return type.\n\nInstead of this:\n\n```c\n[](std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e data, auto) -\u003e std::expected\u003csize_t, Error\u003e { ... }\n\n```\n\nUse this:\n\n```c\n[](std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e data, auto) { ... }\n\n```",
